{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools is a framework-agnostic devtool for managing and debugging devtools plugins across React, Preact, Solid, Vue, Svelte, and Angular. Pick your framework below to get started."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"react","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the devtools and the Vite plugin:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/react-devtools @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" component to the root of your application:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { StrictMode } from 'react'\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To add plugins, pass them via the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"plugins"},{"type":"text","value":" prop. Each plugin needs a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"name"},{"type":"text","value":" and a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"render"},{"type":"text","value":" element:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { StrictMode } from 'react'\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\nimport { ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-query-devtools'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Query',\n          render: <ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Router',\n          render: <TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"preact","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Preact"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the devtools and the Vite plugin:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/preact-devtools @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" component using Preact's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"render()"},{"type":"text","value":" function:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { render } from 'preact'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </>,\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To add plugins, pass them via the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"plugins"},{"type":"text","value":" prop:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { render } from 'preact'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'Your Plugin',\n          render: <YourPluginComponent />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </>,\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"solid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the devtools and the Vite plugin:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/solid-devtools @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" component using Solid's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"render(() => ...)"},{"type":"text","value":" pattern:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { render } from 'solid-js/web'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(() => (\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </>\n), document.getElementById('root')!)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To add plugins, pass them via the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"plugins"},{"type":"text","value":" prop:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { render } from 'solid-js/web'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\nimport { SolidQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/solid-query-devtools'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/solid-router-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(() => (\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Query',\n          render: <SolidQueryDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Router',\n          render: <TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </>\n), document.getElementById('root')!)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"vue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the Vue devtools adapter:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/vue-devtools","lang":"bash"},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Vite plugin ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/devtools-vite"},{"type":"text","value":") is optional for Vue but recommended if you want features like enhanced console logs and go-to-source."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" component in your root template:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <App />\n  <TanStackDevtools />\n</template>","lang":"vue"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To add plugins, define them as an array and pass them via the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":":plugins"},{"type":"text","value":" binding. Vue uses "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"component"},{"type":"text","value":" instead of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"render"},{"type":"text","value":" in plugin definitions:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\nimport type { TanStackDevtoolsVuePlugin } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\nimport { VueQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/vue-query-devtools'\n\nconst plugins: TanStackDevtoolsVuePlugin[] = [\n  { name: 'Vue Query', component: VueQueryDevtoolsPanel },\n]\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <App />\n  <TanStackDevtools :plugins=\"plugins\" />\n</template>","lang":"vue"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"svelte","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the devtools:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/svelte-devtools","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" component to the root of your application:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/svelte-devtools'\n</script>\n\n<main>\n  <!-- Your app content -->\n</main>\n<TanStackDevtools />","lang":"svelte"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To add plugins, define them as an array and pass them via the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"plugins"},{"type":"text","value":" prop. Svelte uses "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"component"},{"type":"text","value":" instead of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"render"},{"type":"text","value":" in plugin definitions:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/svelte-devtools'\n  import type { TanStackDevtoolsSveltePlugin } from '@tanstack/svelte-devtools'\n  import { SvelteQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/svelte-query-devtools'\n\n  const plugins: TanStackDevtoolsSveltePlugin[] = [\n    { name: 'Svelte Query', component: SvelteQueryDevtoolsPanel },\n  ]\n</script>\n\n<main>\n  <!-- Your app content -->\n</main>\n<TanStackDevtools {plugins} />","lang":"svelte"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"angular","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the devtools:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/angular-devtools","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtoolsComponent"},{"type":"text","value":" to the root of your application:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtoolsComponent } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtoolsComponent],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools />\n  `,\n})\nexport class AppComponent {}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To add plugins, define them as an array and pass them via the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"[plugins]"},{"type":"text","value":" input. Angular uses "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"component"},{"type":"text","value":" instead of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"render"},{"type":"text","value":" in plugin definitions:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtoolsComponent } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport type { TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport { AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/angular-query-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtoolsComponent],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools [plugins]=\"plugins\" />\n  `,\n})\nexport class AppComponent {\n  plugins: Array<TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin> = [\n    { name: 'Angular Query', component: AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel },\n  ]\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"vite-plugin","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vite Plugin"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All frameworks benefit from the optional Vite plugin, which provides enhanced console logs, go-to-source, and a server event bus. Install it as a dev dependency:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add it as the "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"first"}]},{"type":"text","value":" plugin in your Vite config:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { devtools } from '@tanstack/devtools-vite'\n\nexport default {\n  plugins: [\n    devtools(),\n    // ... rest of your plugins here\n  ],\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For the full list of Vite plugin options, see the "},{"type":"link","href":"./vite-plugin","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vite Plugin"}]},{"type":"text","value":" documentation."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"react","text":"React","level":2},{"id":"preact","text":"Preact","level":2},{"id":"solid","text":"Solid","level":2},{"id":"vue","text":"Vue","level":2},{"id":"svelte","text":"Svelte","level":2},{"id":"angular","text":"Angular","level":2},{"id":"vite-plugin","text":"Vite Plugin","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Devtools is a framework-agnostic devtool for managing and debugging devtools plugins across React, Preact, Solid, Vue, Svelte, and Angular. Pick your framework below to get started.\n\n## React\n\nInstall the devtools and the Vite plugin:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/react-devtools @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component to the root of your application:\n\n```tsx\nimport { StrictMode } from 'react'\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nTo add plugins, pass them via the `plugins` prop. Each plugin needs a `name` and a `render` element:\n\n```tsx\nimport { StrictMode } from 'react'\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\nimport { ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-query-devtools'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Query',\n          render: <ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Router',\n          render: <TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\n## Preact\n\nInstall the devtools and the Vite plugin:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/preact-devtools @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component using Preact's `render()` function:\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'preact'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </>,\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)\n```\n\nTo add plugins, pass them via the `plugins` prop:\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'preact'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'Your Plugin',\n          render: <YourPluginComponent />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </>,\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)\n```\n\n## Solid\n\nInstall the devtools and the Vite plugin:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/solid-devtools @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component using Solid's `render(() => ...)` pattern:\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'solid-js/web'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(() => (\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </>\n), document.getElementById('root')!)\n```\n\nTo add plugins, pass them via the `plugins` prop:\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'solid-js/web'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\nimport { SolidQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/solid-query-devtools'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/solid-router-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(() => (\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Query',\n          render: <SolidQueryDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Router',\n          render: <TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </>\n), document.getElementById('root')!)\n```\n\n## Vue\n\nInstall the Vue devtools adapter:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/vue-devtools\n```\n\n> The Vite plugin (`@tanstack/devtools-vite`) is optional for Vue but recommended if you want features like enhanced console logs and go-to-source.\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component in your root template:\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <App />\n  <TanStackDevtools />\n</template>\n```\n\nTo add plugins, define them as an array and pass them via the `:plugins` binding. Vue uses `component` instead of `render` in plugin definitions:\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\nimport type { TanStackDevtoolsVuePlugin } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\nimport { VueQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/vue-query-devtools'\n\nconst plugins: TanStackDevtoolsVuePlugin[] = [\n  { name: 'Vue Query', component: VueQueryDevtoolsPanel },\n]\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <App />\n  <TanStackDevtools :plugins=\"plugins\" />\n</template>\n```\n\n## Svelte\n\nInstall the devtools:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/svelte-devtools\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component to the root of your application:\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/svelte-devtools'\n</script>\n\n<main>\n  <!-- Your app content -->\n</main>\n<TanStackDevtools />\n```\n\nTo add plugins, define them as an array and pass them via the `plugins` prop. Svelte uses `component` instead of `render` in plugin definitions:\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/svelte-devtools'\n  import type { TanStackDevtoolsSveltePlugin } from '@tanstack/svelte-devtools'\n  import { SvelteQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/svelte-query-devtools'\n\n  const plugins: TanStackDevtoolsSveltePlugin[] = [\n    { name: 'Svelte Query', component: SvelteQueryDevtoolsPanel },\n  ]\n</script>\n\n<main>\n  <!-- Your app content -->\n</main>\n<TanStackDevtools {plugins} />\n```\n\n## Angular\n\nInstall the devtools:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/angular-devtools\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtoolsComponent` to the root of your application:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtoolsComponent } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtoolsComponent],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools />\n  `,\n})\nexport class AppComponent {}\n```\n\nTo add plugins, define them as an array and pass them via the `[plugins]` input. Angular uses `component` instead of `render` in plugin definitions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtoolsComponent } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport type { TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport { AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/angular-query-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtoolsComponent],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools [plugins]=\"plugins\" />\n  `,\n})\nexport class AppComponent {\n  plugins: Array<TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin> = [\n    { name: 'Angular Query', component: AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel },\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Vite Plugin\n\nAll frameworks benefit from the optional Vite plugin, which provides enhanced console logs, go-to-source, and a server event bus. Install it as a dev dependency:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nAdd it as the **first** plugin in your Vite config:\n\n```ts\nimport { devtools } from '@tanstack/devtools-vite'\n\nexport default {\n  plugins: [\n    devtools(),\n    // ... rest of your plugins here\n  ],\n}\n```\n\nFor the full list of Vite plugin options, see the [Vite Plugin](./vite-plugin) documentation.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Quick Start\nid: quick-start\n---\n\nTanStack Devtools is a framework-agnostic devtool for managing and debugging devtools plugins across React, Preact, Solid, Vue, Svelte, and Angular. Pick your framework below to get started.\n\n## React\n\nInstall the devtools and the Vite plugin:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/react-devtools @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component to the root of your application:\n\n```tsx\nimport { StrictMode } from 'react'\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nTo add plugins, pass them via the `plugins` prop. Each plugin needs a `name` and a `render` element:\n\n```tsx\nimport { StrictMode } from 'react'\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\nimport { ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-query-devtools'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Query',\n          render: <ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Router',\n          render: <TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\n## Preact\n\nInstall the devtools and the Vite plugin:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/preact-devtools @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component using Preact's `render()` function:\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'preact'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </>,\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)\n```\n\nTo add plugins, pass them via the `plugins` prop:\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'preact'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/preact-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'Your Plugin',\n          render: <YourPluginComponent />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </>,\n  document.getElementById('root')!,\n)\n```\n\n## Solid\n\nInstall the devtools and the Vite plugin:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/solid-devtools @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component using Solid's `render(() => ...)` pattern:\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'solid-js/web'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(() => (\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </>\n), document.getElementById('root')!)\n```\n\nTo add plugins, pass them via the `plugins` prop:\n\n```tsx\nimport { render } from 'solid-js/web'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/solid-devtools'\nimport { SolidQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/solid-query-devtools'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/solid-router-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\nrender(() => (\n  <>\n    <App />\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Query',\n          render: <SolidQueryDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Router',\n          render: <TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </>\n), document.getElementById('root')!)\n```\n\n## Vue\n\nInstall the Vue devtools adapter:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/vue-devtools\n```\n\n> The Vite plugin (`@tanstack/devtools-vite`) is optional for Vue but recommended if you want features like enhanced console logs and go-to-source.\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component in your root template:\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <App />\n  <TanStackDevtools />\n</template>\n```\n\nTo add plugins, define them as an array and pass them via the `:plugins` binding. Vue uses `component` instead of `render` in plugin definitions:\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\nimport type { TanStackDevtoolsVuePlugin } from '@tanstack/vue-devtools'\nimport { VueQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/vue-query-devtools'\n\nconst plugins: TanStackDevtoolsVuePlugin[] = [\n  { name: 'Vue Query', component: VueQueryDevtoolsPanel },\n]\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <App />\n  <TanStackDevtools :plugins=\"plugins\" />\n</template>\n```\n\n## Svelte\n\nInstall the devtools:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/svelte-devtools\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtools` component to the root of your application:\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/svelte-devtools'\n</script>\n\n<main>\n  <!-- Your app content -->\n</main>\n<TanStackDevtools />\n```\n\nTo add plugins, define them as an array and pass them via the `plugins` prop. Svelte uses `component` instead of `render` in plugin definitions:\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/svelte-devtools'\n  import type { TanStackDevtoolsSveltePlugin } from '@tanstack/svelte-devtools'\n  import { SvelteQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/svelte-query-devtools'\n\n  const plugins: TanStackDevtoolsSveltePlugin[] = [\n    { name: 'Svelte Query', component: SvelteQueryDevtoolsPanel },\n  ]\n</script>\n\n<main>\n  <!-- Your app content -->\n</main>\n<TanStackDevtools {plugins} />\n```\n\n## Angular\n\nInstall the devtools:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/angular-devtools\n```\n\nAdd the `TanStackDevtoolsComponent` to the root of your application:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtoolsComponent } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtoolsComponent],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools />\n  `,\n})\nexport class AppComponent {}\n```\n\nTo add plugins, define them as an array and pass them via the `[plugins]` input. Angular uses `component` instead of `render` in plugin definitions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtoolsComponent } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport type { TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport { AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/angular-query-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtoolsComponent],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools [plugins]=\"plugins\" />\n  `,\n})\nexport class AppComponent {\n  plugins: Array<TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin> = [\n    { name: 'Angular Query', component: AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel },\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Vite Plugin\n\nAll frameworks benefit from the optional Vite plugin, which provides enhanced console logs, go-to-source, and a server event bus. Install it as a dev dependency:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D @tanstack/devtools-vite\n```\n\nAdd it as the **first** plugin in your Vite config:\n\n```ts\nimport { devtools } from '@tanstack/devtools-vite'\n\nexport default {\n  plugins: [\n    devtools(),\n    // ... rest of your plugins here\n  ],\n}\n```\n\nFor the full list of Vite plugin options, see the [Vite Plugin](./vite-plugin) documentation.\n"}
